{"asset_key":"ep1/env_story_11309110","episode":"ep1","category":"env_story","story_id":"11309110","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1130911001:1":{"text":"원래 계획대로 크림슨 고원에 가서 현지의 트라이브와 가죽을 교환하려고요.","source_cn":"按照原来的计划，我们应该攀上深红高原，和当地的蛮血交换皮货。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x907D8CD31D2B3D16","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1130911002:1":{"text":"이 초코보들만 아니었다면 저희는 진작에 물건을 다 팔고 세일린워터 마을로 돌아갔을 거예요.","source_cn":"要不是被这群陆行鸟拦住了，我们可能早就卖完货，返回咸水镇了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA93D27C63990E7DC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1130911003:1":{"text":"하지만… 몬스터에 대해 말들이 많아서 갈지 말지 고민 중이죠.","source_cn":"但是……现在众说纷纭，我们到底去还是不去呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x011F02D45128B3C4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:行商德博拉":{"text":"행상 데보라","source":"行商德博拉","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":1}}